      "jcr:created": "Wed Oct 05 2022 18:59:11 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Coming soon…</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Season 2&nbsp;</span>with even more content on Mako SmartRobotics™, Revision Knee, Revision Hip and Direct Anterior Approach.</p>\n",
